{
  "name": "Weekly Reviews",
  "description": "The Monday business review an agent writes from the records above: one headline, every team, every risk.",
  "position": 4,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "write-review",
      "label": {
        "en": "Write this Monday’s business review",
        "zh-CN": "写本周一的经营周报"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-okr` skill in this folder and follow it. Write the weekly review for last Monday to Sunday from the objectives, key results, check-ins and actions: a one-line headline, overall progress against the quarter, each team in two lines, every red and watch key result with its cause and action, and what changed since last week.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-okr` Skill，按它的规则做。根据目标、关键结果、进展记录和行动，写上周一到周日的经营周报：一句话结论、整体进度对比时间进度、每个团队两行、每个红灯和黄灯关键结果的原因与行动、与上周相比的变化。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "compare-weeks",
      "label": {
        "en": "What got better or worse since last week?",
        "zh-CN": "和上周比哪些变好了、哪些变差了"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-okr` skill in this folder and follow it. Compare the two latest reviews and the check-ins between them: which key results changed light, which numbers moved most, and which actions closed. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-okr` Skill，按它的规则做。对比最近两份周报和期间的进展记录：哪些关键结果换了灯、哪些数字变动最大、哪些行动完成了。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
